<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$100 MLN   COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    05.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.795   PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
